  "details": "Description\n\noften times when trying to connect to a world with friends it will get stuck in the \"connecting\" screen of the loading screen and loop at infinitum. i will end up having to close the game and attempt to re join. i have reset my router, cleared caches, checked steam. idk how to fix this\n\nReproduction Steps\n\njoin a world on my machine i guess. It occurs when i join a world, enter a portal, load into the game fresh from start up into MY Home world, and generally whenever i try to connect to another instance there is a chance of it breaking.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Networking\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2-1901-4a7d603ee0-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-09-03_20-01-16.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_b888aa15-cc0e-4098-a2d5-7d58263c17ab/1/file)",
